6. # Set operators

## Set selectors DONE
With Set selectors one can create sets based on tags or file properties. Selectors are crunchers but under Filters. Selector create a new File nodes but is does not copy actual files. Original file path is just copied to new File. 

## Set combine
Set combine can be used to combine two or more Sets. No new files are created, just new File nodes.

Decide where the code lives (backend or adapter).
- This needs reference File node, so that we do not create duplicate bitstreams.

